'''Lower Chehalis''' ({{lang|cea|Łəw̓ál̕məš}}) is a member of the [[Tsamosan languages|Tsamosan]] (or [[Olympic Peninsula]]) branch of the [[Coast Salish languages|Coast Salish]] family of [[Salishan languages]]. In some classifications, Lower Chehalis is placed closer to [[Quinault language|Quinault]] than it is to [[Upper Chehalis language|Upper Chehalis]]. It went extinct in the 1990s.

